# Vercel only ever serves the web app (public/ + api/). The native shells are
# checked in alongside it and android/ alone is ~1.1 GB of Gradle build output,
# which pushed a `vercel --prod` upload past the 100 MB per-file limit and made
# CLI deploys fail outright. None of it is used by the build.
android/
ios/
node_modules/

# Local scratch that should never reach a deploy
*.apk
*.aab
app-store-screenshots/
